---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Use | Alpha Crest">
  <Header />
  <main class="pt-32 pb-24 min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-8">Terms of Use</h1>
      <div class="prose prose-invert text-slate-300 space-y-6">
        <p class="text-lg">Welcome to Alpha Crest. By accessing our website, you agree to comply with and be bound by the following terms and conditions.</p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">1. Use of Site</h2>
        <p>The content of this website is for your general information and use only. It is subject to change without notice.</p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">2. Financial Disclaimers</h2>
        <p>Alpha Crest (Pty) Ltd is not an authorized financial services provider (FSP). Our application is pending with the Financial Services Conduct Authority (FSCA). The fund remains closed pending approval. The information on this website does not constitute financial, investment, or advice. Systematic cryptocurrency trading involves substantial risk of loss.</p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">3. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>This website contains material which is owned by or licensed to us. This material includes, but is not limited to, the design, layout, look, appearance, and graphics. Reproduction is prohibited other than in accordance with the copyright notice.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
